# RecoverAI Frontend Environment Configuration

# API Base URL for backend requests
# Leave blank in local development to route through the local Vite dev proxy (/api -> http://localhost:5000)
# In a production or decoupled deployment, set to the absolute URL of the backend API:
# Example: VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://recover-ai-api.onrender.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
